wip/py-polyscope: Import polyscope-2.6.1

Polyscope is a viewer and user interface for 3D data (meshes, point
clouds, curve networks, volume grids, Gaussian splats) with Python
bindings.  Built from the PyPI sdist, which bundles the C++ library
and its dependencies (GLFW, glad, ImGui, glm, Eigen, nanobind); they
are linked statically into the extension.  On macOS it renders with
OpenGL 4.1 on Metal (Apple GPU).
